Usage: tasks list-tasks [OPTIONS]
List tasks with optional lane filtering.
Examples:
spec-kitty agent tasks list-tasks --json
spec-kitty agent tasks list-tasks --lane doing --json
Options
--lane TEXT Filter by lane
--mission TEXT Mission slug
--owned-checkout PATH Explicit checkout root owned by this invocation. Use it to list the tasks of a mission that lives in a linked worktree; the path is validated against this repository before anything is read.
--json Output JSON format
--help -h Show this message and exit.
